  "result": "Perfect! All 468 tests pass (453 previous + 15 new renderInvoiceText enhancement tests).\n\n**Summary of renderInvoiceText enhancements:**\n\n\u2705 **src/render.js** \u2014 Enhanced renderInvoiceText function:\n- Shows line discounts when present (indented with \"Discount: \u20ac...\" format)\n- Shows voucher amount just before total (as \"Voucher: -\u20ac...\" format)\n- Shows due date line when invoice has one (as \"Due: YYYY-MM-DD\" format)\n- Shows paid amount line when invoice has payments (sums all payments as \"Paid: \u20ac...\" format)\n- Maintains existing functionality: status/number, customer name, line items with qty/name/unitPrice/total, VAT line, total line\n\n\u2705 **test/render.test.js** \u2014 15 comprehensive tests for enhancements:\n- Line discount display (shows discount, only for lines with one)\n- Voucher display (before total, only when present)\n- Due date display (shown when present, as last/second-to-last line)\n- Paid amount display (aggregates multiple payments, shown when present, as last line)\n- Combined features test (discount + voucher + due date + payment)\n- Discount line indentation (verified as properly indented)\n- Bulk discount handling (verified to NOT show as separate discount line)\n- Multiple lines with mixed discount patterns\n- Edge cases (empty payments array, missing dueDate, missing voucher)\n\nThe implementation correctly prioritizes what gets shown:\n1. Invoice status/number\n2. Customer name\n3. Line items with their explicit discounts\n4. VAT (if non-zero)\n5. Voucher (if applied)\n6. Total\n7. Due date (if present)\n8. Paid amount (if payments exist)",
